      "end_frame": 32,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Method 1.",
      "start_ms": 1660,
      "end_ms": 2540,
      "start_frame": 50,
      "end_frame": 76,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Fix start, extend end, update running sum, count the match, time, O of n squared, space, O of 1.",
      "start_ms": 3060,
      "end_ms": 12320,
      "start_frame": 92,
      "end_frame": 370,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Correlation.",
      "start_ms": 13120,
      "end_ms": 13880,
      "start_frame": 394,
      "end_frame": 416,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Current prefix minus previous prefix equals k.",
      "start_ms": 14340,
      "end_ms": 16800,
      "start_frame": 430,
      "end_frame": 504,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "So, needed previous prefix equals current prefix minus k.",
      "start_ms": 17320,
      "end_ms": 21100,
      "start_frame": 520,
      "end_frame": 633,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "Method 2.",
      "start_ms": 21380,
      "end_ms": 22400,
      "start_frame": 641,
      "end_frame": 672,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Update prefix.",
      "start_ms": 22720,
      "end_ms": 23720,
      "start_frame": 682,
      "end_frame": 712,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Compute needed.",
      "start_ms": 24460,
      "end_ms": 25460,
      "start_frame": 734,
      "end_frame": 764,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Query its frequency, add the matches, then store the current prefix.",
      "start_ms": 26120,
      "end_ms": 31060,
      "start_frame": 784,
      "end_frame": 932,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Expected time.",
      "start_ms": 31840,
      "end_ms": 33080,
      "start_frame": 955,
      "end_frame": 992,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "O of n space, O of n reusable pattern.",
      "start_ms": 33400,
      "end_ms": 37220,
      "start_frame": 1002,
      "end_frame": 1117,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "If a range condition can be written as current cumulative state minus earlier cumulative state equals target, look for current minus target.",
      "start_ms": 38000,
      "end_ms": 48480,
      "start_frame": 1140,
      "end_frame": 1454,
      "word_count": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "And if multiple earlier states can create valid ranges, store frequency.",
      "start_ms": 49080,
      "end_ms": 54240,
      "start_frame": 1472,
      "end_frame": 1627,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Now question 16.",
      "start_ms": 55000,
      "end_ms": 56240,
      "start_frame": 1650,
      "end_frame": 1687,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Subarray.",
      "start_ms": 56620,
      "end_ms": 57640,
      "start_frame": 1699,
      "end_frame": 1729,
      "word_count": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "Sum equals k is complete.",
      "start_ms": 57760,
      "end_ms": 60200,
      "start_frame": 1733,
      "end_frame": 1806,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Our global progress moves from 15 out of 227 to 16 out of 227, next in arrays and hashing.",
      "start_ms": 60980,
      "end_ms": 72720,
      "start_frame": 1829,
      "end_frame": 2182,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Question 17.",
      "start_ms": 73460,
      "end_ms": 74580,
      "start_frame": 2204,
      "end_frame": 2237,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Encode and decode strings.",
      "start_ms": 74580,
      "end_ms": 77340,
      "start_frame": 2237,
      "end_frame": 2320,
      "word_count": 4
    }
